From: maalh <sometimes7799s@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 12:55:28 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 07/18] feat(web): let a new hire prepare a rental application
 from the agent view

A hire added during the demo reached the housing step with no way to get a
draft: only seeded hires had one. The agent view now offers a primary
'Prepare application' action for the fixture unit, which creates the draft and
the approval together. The risk summary is plain language and never states
the salary or a ratio.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
